        "en": "Boxed warning: risk of severe neurotoxicity (vestibular and cochlear dysfunction, optic nerve dysfunction, peripheral neuritis, encephalopathy) is sharply increased with impaired renal function or prerenal azotaemia; monitor renal function and hearing."
